Package: gard
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Marco Rojas <marcorojas@me.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/gard-net/gard
Description: LAN quality measurement CLI (LSP/1.2)
 gard measures throughput, latency, jitter and packet loss on a local
 network link between two peers that speak the Landspeed Protocol
 (LSP/1.2). Think of it as a LAN-focused cousin of iperf3 with mDNS
 discovery and no central server.
